    "body": "## Summary\n- expire stale `PAYMENT_REQUIRED` publications during idempotent create replay\n- restore any wallet reservation through the existing idempotent `JOB_PUBLICATION_RELEASE` ledger operation\n- return terminal `CANCELLED` instead of a stale payable response\n- add regression coverage and document replay expiry semantics\n\n## Why\nA retry with the same `requestId` previously returned an expired pending publication unchanged until another read path or the scheduler processed it. That could leave the client with a stale payable state and delay releasing reserved wallet funds.\n\n## Safety\n- same-payload idempotency is preserved\n- different-payload reuse still conflicts before any expiry mutation\n- no new payment/ledger operation type or migration is required\n- release remains idempotent via the existing publication release operation key\n",
